d abilities. Every member of your crew is a playable character! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/d9e0a4eebcfd865f78987338d5eaf10c.webp?t=1787302676\" width=90 height=24 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the console in your ship to unlock new items or permanent upgrades to boost your fighting chances in the next run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/517e7067f02a8138b5916d9334a6317d.webp?t=1787302676\" width=90 height=24 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your friends in an intense local multiplayer experience with Deathmatch and Teams game modes. All the hacking mechanics are here, including control panels, regeneration, and weapon upgrading, so you can bet there will be some competitive and clutch moments.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/extras/ba7da913eadd942ef6ee0769ec658499.webp?t=1787302676\" width=90 height=24 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluid player movement and twin-stick shooting, with unlockable special moves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Millions of fierce weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture any enemy to fight for you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of powerful turrets </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite replayability through procedurally generated levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple playable characters with different traits and abilities to suit any playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interesting skills that add new mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of optional routes for extra loot or upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings based on your personal progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meta-progression through the ship console to increase your chances in the next run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A multitude of secrets</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Shoot &gt; Loot &gt; Hack &gt; Die &gt; Repeat. Glitch Hunt is a cyberpunk action-RPG roguelike. Capture droid enemies, equip and evolve them. Hack and control powerful turrets. Synergize skills and an abundance of gear to build your playstyle. Explore procedural maps and destroy SINUS, humanity's AI “saviour”.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/f3080b512b1a361921b2dbd33c4baa1f9b56fc73/header_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1787302676", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/182a3db49687d3bdecedd601e4bf8f75a8352638/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1787302676", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1966400/182a3db49687d3bdecedd601e4bf8f75a8352638/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1787302676", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia 450 GTS / Radeon HD 5750 or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 600 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> DirectX 9.1+</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong